### ==============================
### USER APIs
### ==============================


### 1. GET ALL USERS
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users


### 2. GET USER BY ID
### Replace USER_ID with an actual MongoDB user ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users/6a9936d07d01a0c123255d4a


### 3. UPDATE USER NAME
### Replace USER_ID with an actual MongoDB user ID
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/users/6a9936d07d01a0c123255d4a
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Kranthi Goud"
}


### 4. DELETE USER
### Replace USER_ID with an actual MongoDB user ID
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/users/6a9becdacf1bdbae2e937994
Authorization:  Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI2YTliZWViNGNmMWJkYmFlMmU5Mzc5OTYiLCJyb2xlIjoiSVQgTWFuYWdlciIsImlhdCI6MTc4ODYwNDEwMCwiZXhwIjoxNzg4NjkwNTAwfQ.l61c4kji_JGA-f3A3-OWMMC_Y5XTRjfju4jdrgXGBJc

